{
  "name": "ComptaFlow - Onboarding Automatisé",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "comptaflow-onboarding-webhook",
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Stripe Payment Success",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [100, 300],
      "webhookId": "comptaflow-onboarding-trigger"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fromEmail": "Comptaflow <support@compta-flow.net>",
        "toEmail": "={{$json.body.customer_details.email}}",
        "subject": "Bienvenue chez ComptaFlow - Votre Onboarding commence ici 🚀",
        "html": "=<h1>Bienvenue {{$json.body.customer_details.name}} !</h1><p>Nous sommes ravis de vous accompagner dans la gestion de votre entreprise.</p><p>Votre compte est désormais actif. Vous pouvez accéder à votre dashboard ici : <a href='https://compta-flow.net/dashboard'>Dashboard ComptaFlow</a></p><p>Prochaine étape : Téléchargez vos premiers documents dans votre <strong>Vault</strong> sécurisé.</p><p>À très vite,<br>L'équipe Comptaflow</p>",
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Send Welcome Email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailSend",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [400, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "smtp": {
          "id": "YOUR_RESEND_SMTP_ID",
          "name": "Resend SMTP"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "folder",
        "name": "={{$json.body.customer_details.name}} - Archives Fiscales",
        "parentFolder": "YOUR_ROOT_FOLDER_ID"
      },
      "name": "Create Client Vault",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleDrive",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [650, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "googleDriveApi": {
          "id": "YOUR_GOOGLE_DRIVE_ID",
          "name": "Google Drive Account"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Stripe Payment Success": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Send Welcome Email",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Send Welcome Email": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Create Client Vault",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": {}
}
